  "job_B3.4.18_20251003_114733": {
    "text": "Gecynd onwrigen, & seo syn adilegod.\nOnd w\u00e6s se dom oncyrred Euan unges\u00e6lignesse \u00fe\u00e6t hire w\u00e6s togecweden, \u00fe\u00e6t heo cende on sare & on\nMaria cende \u00feone mildheortan & \u00feone unsce\u00fe\u00feendan Crist on hire inno\u00fee; Eua b\u00e6r tearas on hire\nMaria brohte \u00feurh heo \u00feone ecean gefean eallum middangearde; Eua cende hire bearn on sare; for\u00feon \u00fee\nSe Halga Gast seow \u00fe\u00e6t cl\u00e6ne s\u00e6d on \u00feone unbesmitenan inno\u00fe; for\u00feon heo f\u00e6mne cende, for\u00f0on heo\nGabriel w\u00e6s \u00feissa bryd\u00feinga \u00e6rendwreca.\nHw\u00e6t cw\u00e6\u00fe he to hire, o\u00fe\u00fee hw\u00e6t gehyrde heo, \u00fe\u00e6r he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Wes \u00feu hal, Maria, geofena full, Drihten\n& from \u00feisse halettunge heo w\u00e6s geeacnod; for\u00feon \u00fee he hire \u00fea ecean h\u00e6lo on his tungon brohte.\nDeofol \u00feonne \u00feurh \u00fea attor berendan n\u00e6ddran, mid hire \u00fe\u00e6re yfelan sceonesse & facne, beswac \u00feone\nSeo geofu w\u00e6s broht for \u00fe\u00e6re synne \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6restan wifes.\nHeo w\u00e6s ful cweden n\u00e6s \u00e6metugu, for\u00f0on \u00fee heo w\u00e6s mid gife gefylled, & seo synn w\u00e6s adilegod.\nGehyron we nu to hwylcum gemete seo arwyr\u00fee f\u00e6mne & seo halige, on hire cantice gefeonde and\nHe cw\u00e6\u00fe se engel to hire, Wes \u00feu hal, Maria, geofena ful; Drihten is mid \u00fee, on \u00feinre heortan & on\nAc blissa \u00feu, f\u00e6mne, for\u00f0on \u00fee Crist of heofona heanessum & of \u00fe\u00e6m engelicum \u00ferymmum on \u00feinne\n\u00dey \u00fee he hine onfeh\u00fe, ne beluce\u00fe he hine no; ac se geleafa sceal beon fram eor\u00fean up to heofonum\nHw\u00e6t we nu gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t se heofonlica cyning ineode on \u00feone medmycclan inno\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re a cl\u00e6nan\nHe cw\u00e6\u00fe se engel to hire, Wes \u00feu gebletsod betuh eall wifa cynn; for\u00feon se w\u00e6stm \u00feines inno\u00fees is\nOn \u00fe\u00e6s engles wordum w\u00e6s gehyred \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurh hire beor\u00feor sceolde beon geh\u00e6led eall wifa cynn &\nSeo \u00e6reste modor \u00feyses menniscan cynnes wr\u00e6cwite middangearde brohte, \u00fea heo Godes bebodu\nHeo h\u00e6fde hire sylfre geworht \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste wite & eallum hire cynne, ge \u00fe\u00e6t wite w\u00e6s to \u00fe\u00e6s strang \u00fe\u00e6t\nLufian hie nu for\u00feon eall wifa cynn & wera, & hie weor\u00f0ian, wordum & d\u00e6dum for.\nMycel bewreah, heo onfeng on hire medmycclan bosm God F\u00e6der Sunu, \u00feone ne magon befon heofon\nLufian we urne Sceppend & hine herian \u00e6fter urum gemete, ealle m\u00e6gene, swa we gehyran magon \u00fe\u00e6t\n& bli\u00fee mode heo sang on \u00fe\u00e6m cantice & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe, Min saul myccla\u00fe Drihten & min gast wynsuma\u00fe\nOf \u00feon me eadige cw\u00e6don ealle cneorisna; for\u00feon he me mycel dyde se \u00fee mihtig is, & his noma halig,\nDrihten com on middangeard mid Israhela cynne, and him eces lifes bysene onstealde, & hie to heofona\nOnd hie nu his lare forhogodan, & him \u00e6fest to genaman, and hine on rode ahengon.\n& he \u00feurh his \u00ferowunga \u00feone ealdan gedwolan oforswi\u00fede, & deofles rice gene\u00feerode on \u00feyssum\n& \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s Euan wop ute betyned \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6re a cl\u00e6nan f\u00e6mnan, \u00fe\u00e6r is to tacne, \u00fe\u00e6t heo Maria \u00e6fter\nSe heofonlica \u00e6rendwreca hire \u00fea cy\u00fede & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Ne ondr\u00e6d \u00feu \u00fee, Maria, \u00feu \u00fee gemetest gife\nMid \u00fey \u00fee heo gehyrde \u00feone fruman \u00f0\u00e6s godcundan tuddres, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe heo \u00feus: Hu m\u00e6g \u00feis \u00feus\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se engel to hire, Se Halga Gast cyme\u00fe ufon on \u00fee, & \u00fe\u00e6s Hehstan m\u00e6gen \u00fee embsele\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t\nEft he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Openige nu \u00fein se f\u00e6gresta f\u00e6\u00fem & se cl\u00e6na, & sy \u00fe\u00e6t geteld a\u00feened \u00feines inno\u00f0es, &\nOnd seo gecyndelice h\u00e6tu \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6gen \u00feas Halgan Gastes seo gestille\u00fe on \u00fee, & sy \u00fein \u00fe\u00e6t\nSeo r\u00e6dnes \u00fe\u00e6re rosan lixe\u00fe on \u00fee, & seo hwitnes \u00fe\u00e6re lilian scine\u00fe on \u00fee, & mid eallum missenlicum\nSe engel \u00fea eft cw\u00e6\u00fe, ondswara, \u00feu f\u00e6mne, to hwon yldestu middangeard to onlyhtenne?\n& Drihtnes engel bide\u00fe \u00feinre ge\u00feafunga.\nHw\u00e6t \u00feu nu gehyrdest hu hit beon m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t se Halga Gast cume\u00fe ufan on \u00fee, & \u00fe\u00e6s Hehstan m\u00e6gen\nIu geara heofonrices duru, \u00fee ic w\u00e6s \u00feurh hider onsended belocen stande\u00fe \u00feurh \u00fea \u00e6restan men, nu heo\nEala \u00feu eadige Maria, eall \u00feeos geh\u00e6ftworld bide\u00fe \u00feinre ge\u00feafunga.\nFor\u00feon \u00fee God \u00fee hafa\u00fe to gisle her on middangearde geseted, & Adames gylt \u00feurh \u00fee sceal beon\n\u00deurh \u00fee sceal beon se ingang eft geopenod, & \u00feu gehelpest \u00feysses menniscan cynnes; for\u00feon se\n& he forgife\u00fe eall swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00fees middangeard \u00e6r wi\u00fe hine \u00e6bylig\u00f0a geworhte.\nEala men \u00fea leofestan, mycel w\u00e6s \u00fees \u00e6rendwreca, & mycel \u00e6rende brohte he; for\u00feon his nama w\u00e6s\nWel \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s gecweden, for\u00feon \u00fee se h\u00e6fde m\u00e6gen ofer ealle gesceafta \u00fee he towearde s\u00e6gde &\n\u00deonne cy\u00fee\u00fe se godspellere \u00fe\u00e6t seo eadige f\u00e6mne Sancta Maria forhtode, & bifigendre stefne\nEala hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s f\u00e6ger ea\u00f0modnes gemeted on \u00fe\u00e6re a cl\u00e6nan f\u00e6mnan.\nSe engel hire s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t heo sceolde modor beon hire Scyppendes, & heo hie sylfe to \u00f0eowene\n& he \u00fea se heofonlica \u00e6rendwreca eft ham cerde on \u00f0a uplican ricu, \u00feonon \u00fee he \u00e6r sended w\u00e6s.\nHe \u00fea Drihten on \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan brydbure, & on \u00fe\u00e6m gerisnlican hehsetle onfeng lichoman gegyrelan\n\u00dea w\u00e6s gesended \u00fe\u00e6t goldhord \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6gen\u00ferymmes on \u00feone bend \u00fe\u00e6s cl\u00e6nan inno\u00f0es; & he \u00fea \u00e6fter\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t se wuldorcyning on middangeard cwom for\u00fe of \u00fe\u00e6m inno\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6re a cl\u00e6nan\nHe sealde his \u00feone readan gim, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s his \u00fe\u00e6t halige blod, mid \u00feon he us gedyde d\u00e6lnimende \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00deonne forhtia\u00fe ealle gesceafta, ge heofonware ge eor\u00feware.\nGifeon we \u00feonne on \u00feone gemanan Godes & manna, & on \u00feone gemanan \u00fe\u00e6s brydguman & \u00fe\u00e6re\nArweor\u00feian we Crist on binne asetene; for\u00feon \u00fee \u00feurh \u00fea ea\u00f0modnesse feowerfealdlice mid\nWeor\u00feian we eac \u00fea cla\u00feas his hades, of \u00fe\u00e6m w\u00e6s ure gecynd geedneowod.\nWeor\u00feian we Sancta Marian; for\u00feon \u00fee heo is us to herianne & to eadgienne, for\u00feon \u00fee heo engla\nSwa is to lyfenne \u00fe\u00e6t englas hie georne beheoldan of \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge \u00fee hie wiston \u00fe\u00e6t heo seo eadige\nOn hire w\u00e6s gefylled \u00fe\u00e6tte on Cantica Canticorum w\u00e6s gesungen, & \u00feus gecweden: Salomones reste\nEno nu hw\u00e6t w\u00e6s seo Salomones r\u00e6ste elles buton se halga inno\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re a cl\u00e6nan?\n\u00deone inno\u00fe geceas & gesohte se gesibsuma cyning ure Drihten H\u00e6lend Crist.\nAc hw\u00e6t m\u00e6nde \u00fe\u00e6t syxtig wera strongera \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r stondende w\u00e6ron ymb \u00fea reste for nihtlicum ege?\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t seo halige f\u00e6mne w\u00e6s ymbseald mid \u00feon heofonlican campweorode engla \u00fereatas\nOn \u00feissum d\u00e6ge astag \u00fe\u00e6t heofonlice goldhord on \u00feysne ymbhwyrft fram \u00fe\u00e6m heahsetle ure\nFor\u00f0on lufian we urne Drihten mid eallum urum life, & ofer ealle o\u00feru \u00feing; for\u00f0on \u00fee he hine sylfne\nFor\u00f0on we sceolan eall ure lif on ea\u00femodnesse healdan, \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re bysne \u00fe\u00e6re halgan Godes\nSwa heo on \u00fe\u00e6m wordum cy\u00f0de, \u00fea heo Drihten herede, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Gemycclige min saul Drihten.\nNe herede heo hine no mid wordum anum, ac mid ealre heortan.\nLufian we hine nu & his noman mycclian n\u00e6s no on gesundum \u00feingum anum, ac eac swylce on\nGif we \u00feurh ea\u00femodnesse eall ar\u00e6fna\u00fe, \u00feonne bi\u00fe Drihten ure se trumesta sta\u00feol, & se selosta scyld,\nHeo cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic eom mines Drihtnes \u00feeowen; geweor\u00fee me \u00e6fter \u00feinum wordum.\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s anr\u00e6dlicu ea\u00femodnes \u00fe\u00e6t heo sylf hie \u00feeowen nemde, & hire cy\u00f0de se engel \u00fe\u00e6t heo w\u00e6s\nWel \u00fe\u00e6t geras \u00fe\u00e6t heo w\u00e6re ea\u00f0mod \u00fea heo \u00feone ea\u00femodan cyning b\u00e6r & \u00f0one mildheortan, se be\nWel \u00fe\u00e6t eac gedafena\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he to eor\u00fean astige \u00feurh \u00fea cl\u00e6nan leomu \u00fe\u00e6re halgan f\u00e6mnan \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00fee\nNu \u00feonne, men \u00fea leofestan, gelyfan we on urne Drihten, & hine lufian, & his bebodu healdan, \u00feonne\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re gesih\u00f0e wesa\u00f0 ealle geleaffulle, and his blisse ne bi\u00f0 n\u00e6nig ende, ah hie a motan mid him",
